  "title": "ECU Tailgate Wings",
  "description": "This recipe has been passed on for years and years of tailgating at East Carolina University down in Greenville, NC. If you are a wing lover than you will truly enjoy these! They bring out all the key things to make wings taste GREAT! It give you sweetness, zing, and as muck kick as you desire",
